  unitName: Trinity Goddess Htilit (EU)
  unitId: 750257
  unitNumber: 7213
  description: "A clone in the image of Htilit, Goddess of the Trinity. She is thus
    named due to the three power sources that she possesses: Llewxam\u2019s power
    of the portal, the Grail, and Corruption. This divinity is behind the events
    related to Sagrav in the Mirror world, as well as the Convergence. Htilit likes
    to \u201Cplay,\u201D as she puts it, with humans. That\u2019s why she decided
    to try to conquer her home world, the Mirror world. After failing, she decided
    to prepare a much more elaborate plan. After the events with Yggdrasil, she managed
    to capture Llewxam in order to torture her, but more than that, she wanted to
    steal her powers. She then managed to obtain the Grail and control the Corruption
    to form her infamous trinity. All of this power allowed her to threaten the universe
    by using machines to disrupt the Rift. She then hoped to take control of the
    powerful Apex champions so she could \u201Cplay\u201D with them. Despite her
    great power, this clone is incomplete since she doesn't possess the true powers
    of the trinity."
  summonDesc: Never give up! You need to become the most powerful of my toys!
  fusionDesc: "My trinity is perfect! I don\u2019t need any more, but if you insist..."
